 r←Test_TableEdit_202(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;⎕TRAP;table;rowTitles
⍝ Test quitting the table editor. Changes are made and the user shall be prompted and will press "Yes".
 r←∆Inactive
 :Return

 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 table←⍪'Obama' 'Bush' 'Clinton' 'Reagan' 'Kennedy'
 table,←'Barak' 'George' 'Bill' 'Ronald' 'John'
 table,←?5 10⍴1000000
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Table.CreateParms
 parms.posn←35 25
 parms.size←400 600
 parms.caption←'Test_TableEdit_202: check "Close" with changes'
 parms.confirmQuit←1
 parms.testMode←1
 parms.testParms←1 2⍴'AskFor_SaveChanges'(('autoPress' 0)('timeout' 0.1))

 n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Table.Create table #._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults parms
 n.Grid ∆KeyPress'Ford'         ⍝ we need a change
 n.Grid ∆KeyPress⊂'ER'          ⍝ Make it permanent
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 1 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'Close'
 0.1 ∆Process n.∆Form

 table[0;0]←⊂'Ford'
 →GoToTidyUp table≢n.∆result

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
